# Optional: get a Discord ping when she picks "Permission Granted" or "Send HD First".
# 1. Discord → your server → a channel → Edit Channel → Integrations → Webhooks → New Webhook → Copy URL
# 2. Copy this file to ".env" and paste the URL below.
# 3. On Netlify/Vercel, add the same key in the dashboard's Environment Variables.
# Leave it unset and the buttons just show their friendly messages (no ping).
VITE_DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL=
